    ;;
    completion|completions) cat <<'EOF'
perch completion — print a shell-completion script for project + command names.

USAGE
  perch completion [zsh|bash]     (auto-detects your shell if omitted)

Install (once):
  zsh:   echo 'source <(perch completion zsh)'  >> ~/.zshrc   && exec zsh
  bash:  echo 'source <(perch completion bash)' >> ~/.bashrc

Then `perch <TAB>` completes commands and your registered project names.
