    ;;
    "health"|wait) cat <<'EOF'
perch health checks — know when a server is actually up.

  perch <project> --wait    launch, then block until the port is listening (or 40s)
  perch <prefix>            a cluster starts backends first, waits for them to be
                            healthy, THEN starts the dependents (web/admin)

`perch list` / `perch fav list` already mark each project up / down / stale by port.
